{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"90238a0406da06cf","name":"card_event_sabotage","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/France/events/card_event_sabotage","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"SABOTAGE","text":"Choose 1 of 3 cards in the enemy hand. Discard it and add a copy to your hand.","flavorText":"Men and women from the French resistance planned, coordinated and executed many acts of sabotage against the German occupation troops and the Vichy government. Favorite targets were railways, phone lines and power supplies, anything that caused a disturbance for the occupying forces. Prior to D-Day 1944 the French Resistance executed a sabotage plan at the request of the British S.O.E.. The aim of the operation was to delay the transport of German troops and ammunition to the front, and in two days, 98 locomotives had been destroyed by the French Resistance.","faction":"France","type":"order","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":7,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_sabotage","title":{"Namespace":"card_france","Key":"card_event_sabotage_title","SourceString":"SABOTAGE","LocalizedString":"SABOTAGE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::France","kredits":7,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_france","Key":"card_event_sabotage_text","SourceString":"Choose 1 of 3 cards in the enemy hand. Discard it and add a copy to your hand.","LocalizedString":"Choose 1 of 3 cards in the enemy hand. Discard it and add a copy to your hand."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_france","Key":"card_event_sabotage_history","SourceString":"Men and women from the French resistance planned, coordinated and executed many acts of sabotage against the German occupation troops and the Vichy government. Favorite targets were railways, phone lines and power supplies, anything that caused a disturbance for the occupying forces. Prior to D-Day 1944 the French Resistance executed a sabotage plan at the request of the British S.O.E.. 